{"id":12374,"author":"L3G1TN00BZ","body":"\u003cb\u003eName\u003c/b\u003e: L3G1TN00BZ\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eReason\u003c/b\u003e: Permanently banned for advertising other server (FIRST OFFENCE)\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhy i should be Unbanned\u003c/b\u003e: i think i should be unbanned because i was just trying to help the server i was making a DTM map for you guys but i needed more help so thats why i advertised my server i could see where you could have thought that i was trying to steal all of your players but really i was trying to make you guys have more players please unban me and before you deny this appeal just know this there is this one guy that has been temp banned 5 times and banned once if you guys want a picture... oh and i saw the post on \"appealing an infraction\" so to the second part of that... yes it was false, yes i have evidence, yes ive waited long enough, no i have not been caught ban evading, yes i have. i at least hope i get some points for honesty. i also deserve a second chance\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://scontent-sjc.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xtp1/v/t1.0-9/11148600_1620298558191195_4911241375640920566_n.jpg?oh=f0919435d293406459ea4d1d8413e70f\u0026amp;oe=55A88443\" title=\"Image: http://scontent-sjc.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xtp1/v/t1.0-9/11148600_1620298558191195_4911241375640920566_n.jpg?oh=f0919435d293406459ea4d1d8413e70f\u0026amp;oe=55A88443\"\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cb\u003eName\u003c/b\u003e: L3G1TN00BZ\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eReason\u003c/b\u003e: Permanently banned for advertising other server (FIRST OFFENCE)\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhy i should be Unbanned\u003c/b\u003e: i think i should be unbanned because i was just trying to help the server i was making a DTM map for you guys but i needed more help so thats why i advertised my server i could see where you could have thought that i was trying to steal all of your players but really i was trying to make you guys have more players please unban me